sanctioned: this program uses Db.open + Db.withTransaction + Db.exec (SqlValue params) + Db.findByConditions (Dict String String conditions) — the Go backend and Ipê share the Ipe stdlib surface but the Go reference emits Go+SQLite binaries while Ipê emits Rust+sqlx; the SQLite in-memory behaviour and row-type representation differ enough that a shared Main.ipe cannot run on both backends. Ipê's output is recorded as the correct reference.
